  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together fish sauce, lime juice, ginger, garlic, brown sugar, and black pepper.",
    "3. Add the sliced pork to the marinade and mix until coated.",
    "4. Thread the marinated pork onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "5. Brush the skewers with vegetable oil and sprinkle with chopped peanuts.",
    "6. Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "7. Roast in the preheated oven for 15-20 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "8. Remove from the oven and let rest for 5 minutes before serving."
